<file path=".github/pull_request_template.md">
## Summary

Briefly describe the problem and the approach taken. Link related discussion if relevant.

## Changes

- What changed at a high level (APIs, behavior, internals)
- Any notable implications (performance, backwards compatibility)

## Tests

- Describe test coverage added/updated (paths in `tests/testthat/`)
- Note any skipped tests and why

## Docs

- Roxygen updated (`devtools::document()`)?
- Vignettes/README updated if user-facing?
- `pkgdown::build_site()` locally if needed

## Screenshots (UI)

Attach screenshots/GIFs for `validate_app()` or UI-facing changes.

## Checklist

- [ ] Linked issue(s) (e.g., Fixes #123)
- [ ] Added/updated tests
- [ ] Updated docs/vignettes
- [ ] Added NEWS bullet
- [ ] `devtools::test()` passes locally
- [ ] `devtools::check(--as-cran)` passes locally

## Notes for Reviewers

Anything risky, hidden assumptions, or follow-ups to flag.
</file>

